// ============================================================================
// INT VPP - marker icon registry (VanillaPPMap fork, concept B «ОБЗОР», 2026-11-12)
// GENERATED by mod_intenso_VppMap/asset_src/icons/build_icons.py from icons.json:
// edit the generator / icons.json and rebuild, do not edit this file by hand.
//
// 60 icons in 10 groups (picker order) + UI marks. Every texture is a WHITE mask
// (RGB white, shape in alpha, 64x64 DXT5 .paa): tint it with SetColor.
// New paths use FORWARD slashes: a marker's icon path is stored in the players'
// JSON (MarkerInfo.M_ICON_PATH, $profile:MapMarkersCache.json).
// Path lookups are case-insensitive and accept forward and back slashes.
// Old VPP icon paths are recognised by INT_IsLegacyPath (draw such markers
// as-is): VanillaPPMap\GUI\Textures\CustomMapIcons\*.paa, VPP's default
// dz\gear\navigation\data\map_border_cross_ca.paa and the other vanilla
// dz\gear\navigation\data\map_*_ca.paa symbols VPP's old picker offered.
// Unknown paths (e.g. RF server markers) are neither own nor legacy: the map
// decides how to draw them.
// 3_Game, no client-only calls: safe on the dedicated server.
// Every internal call is qualified (INT_VPP_Icons.X): bare calls can bind to
// a class of the same name in another mod (Hook()/Hud() trap).
// ============================================================================

